def _pf_concat(xs, ys):
    return xs + ys
def collect(n, acc):
    if n == 0:
        return acc
    else:
        return collect(n - 1, _pf_concat(acc, [lambda k: n]))
--- stderr ---
note: `collect` calls itself in tail position but keeps its recursive form: a closure in it captures `n`
